# tools.list — the tools ~/dev/go/README.md lists, with their path and version.
# command | how to ask its version | what it is for
go    | go version    | builds, runs, tests, formats and documents: `go run .`, `go test`, `go doc`
gofmt | -             | the one Go format: `gofmt -w .` (or `go fmt`)
gopls | gopls version | the language server the editors use
dlv   | dlv version   | Delve, the Go debugger: `dlv debug`, then `break main.main`, `continue`
